1) Fix the UTF-8 logging error (the charmap emoji crash)
Cause: your logger or file handler is using a non-UTF-8 encoding (common on Windows). The diamond emoji 💎 (U+1F48E) can’t be encoded with the default code page.

Quick fixes (pick what's relevant):

A — Python (recommended): explicit UTF-8 logging

