2) Fix the Docker daemon / “CreateFile … cannot find the file specified” error
What the log means: your health check tried to contact Docker but couldn’t reach the Docker daemon/socket. On Windows that Common error is because the Docker Engine (or Docker Desktop) isn’t running or the socket path is wrong.

